      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALOFT (1) shapes well after a handy run last time, finishing third in a Grade 4/5 at this track in 16.77. In form and looks the one to beat. PLAY LAB (6) ran good time (19.91) winning a Special conditions Veteran race at Traralgon when jumping from this same box. Rates a leading chance again. LILAH RAINBOW (8) is a well performed sprinter ideally suited at the shorter trips. Scored over 390m at Shepparton last time in a Grade 5 (22.21). Has a good record here at this journey including two wins. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. HIJACK (7) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
